Subject: xterm_io.h: select POSIX termios on substrate

xterm_io.h's per-OS cascade has no entry for substrate, so none of
USE_POSIX_TERMIOS / USE_SYSV_TERMIO is set and the build stops at
"#error Neither termio or termios is enabled".  Substrate provides
POSIX <termios.h> + tcgetattr/tcsetattr; select USE_POSIX_TERMIOS.

--- a/xterm_io.h
+++ b/xterm_io.h
@@ -110,6 +110,10 @@
 #if defined(__osf__)
 #define USE_POSIX_TERMIOS
 #undef SYSV
+#endif
+
+#ifdef __substrate__
+#define USE_POSIX_TERMIOS	/* substrate provides POSIX <termios.h> */
 #endif
 
